                                "sense_id": "fb2a5feb-9e6f-3ad0-9caa-6c5db915aa68",
                                "text": "“Sanford Finkelstein,” Danielle repeats. “Listen, isn't he the one that ostrich is based on, in your books?”\n“Well, I suppose in a way.” Erica smiles. “It was the name mostly. Sanford seemed like a good name for an ostrich.”"
